# Dockerfile-specific allowlist for a repository-root build context.
**
!firebase/
!firebase/worker/
!firebase/worker/package.json
!firebase/worker/package-lock.json
!firebase/worker/tsconfig.json
!firebase/worker/src/
!firebase/worker/src/*.ts
!firebase/cloud-run/
!firebase/cloud-run/Dockerfile
!firebase/cloud-run/adapter.cjs
!firebase/cloud-run/server.cjs
